    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.poster.avif?t=1754859305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.webm?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.mp4?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech is a top-down survival game where you'll do a lot more than crush other mechs - You trade, hack, dig, plant, loot, upgrade, sneak, free prisoners. If you like games that don't take themselves and their scenario too serious while still providing a good, deep challenge - hit that wishlist button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.poster.avif?t=1754859305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.webm?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.mp4?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech takes place in a randomized wasteland where earthquakes and volcanic eruptions are a daily occurrence. You control Tasha, a renegade with a heart of gold (or rather silver). She is trapped in this area surrounded by deadly artifacts, together with ruthless militias and a bunch of mad punks with bad teeth and rocket launchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A frontal attack is not always the best option - Cut energy supplies, sabotage air support or hack a defensive turret. Develop a strategy and break free from the oppression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.poster.avif?t=1754859305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.webm?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.mp4?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting isn't everything\u2014if you want to survive, you'll have to try to grow something in this dead world. But you can't do it alone. So set up a cozy base, find allies and watch them harvest your crops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.poster.avif?t=1754859305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.webm?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.mp4?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a nice side effect, they will help you maintain your mech and produce ammunition. If you find some raw materials. And machinery. And fuel to operate them. There is a lot to do.  <br><strong><i>Better get going.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is played with mouse and keyboard. Controller support may be added at a later date.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.poster.avif?t=1754859305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.webm?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8c7b9b740aa673da119d39096defd14e.mp4?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech is a top-down survival game where you'll do a lot more than crush other mechs - You trade, hack, dig, plant, loot, upgrade, sneak, free prisoners. If you like games that don't take themselves and their scenario too serious while still providing a good, deep challenge - hit that wishlist button.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.poster.avif?t=1754859305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.webm?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/8f47a8675b97c9b394acd857bced31a9.mp4?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Mech takes place in a randomized wasteland where earthquakes and volcanic eruptions are a daily occurrence. You control Tasha, a renegade with a heart of gold (or rather silver). She is trapped in this area surrounded by deadly artifacts, together with ruthless militias and a bunch of mad punks with bad teeth and rocket launchers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A frontal attack is not always the best option - Cut energy supplies, sabotage air support or hack a defensive turret. Develop a strategy and break free from the oppression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.poster.avif?t=1754859305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.webm?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/98495a591631870393eb588882d605d6.mp4?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting isn't everything\u2014if you want to survive, you'll have to try to grow something in this dead world. But you can't do it alone. So set up a cozy base, find allies and watch them harvest your crops. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.poster.avif?t=1754859305\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.webm?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2482110/extras/d6236eb7ce54de66272f6d2ea4e42089.mp4?t=1754859305\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As a nice side effect, they will help you maintain your mech and produce ammunition. If you find some raw materials. And machinery. And fuel to operate them. There is a lot to do.  <br><strong><i>Better get going.</i></strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Note: This game is played with mouse and keyboard. Controller support may be added at a later date.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "Pilot your trusty Mech in this post-apocalyptic survival game with base building and farming elements. Trade, plant, hack, dig, talk and fight your way through the wasteland. Stop the oppression of a mad general and reunite with your family.",
